          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q5. Suppose you have to get each of these shapes with some folds and a single straight cut. How will you do it?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.277,
            0.466,
            0.294
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a. The hole in the centre is square.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.304,
            0.481,
            0.321
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "b. The hole in the centre is a square.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.331,
            0.881,
            0.367
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Note : For the above two questions, check if the 4-sided figures in the centre satisfy both the properties of a square."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.376,
            0.606,
            0.394
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " a. At first fold the paper horizontally then vertically."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.404,
            0.678,
            0.421
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now cut a small square at the center (all sides closed corner)."
            }
          ]
        },
